WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:03.120
Most people meet AI through a chat window.

2
00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:06.880
Ask a question, get an
answer, decide what's next.

3
00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:09.707
But real work rarely ends with one answer.

4
00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:12.866
A feature needs research, code, tests,

5
00:00:12.867 --> 00:00:15.467
a review, and a record of the decisions.

6
00:00:15.550 --> 00:00:19.067
So think of RuFlo as a
workshop, not another chatbot.

7
00:00:19.319 --> 00:00:21.779
Four pieces are easy to confuse.

8
00:00:21.919 --> 00:00:23.738
The model does the reasoning.

9
00:00:23.739 --> 00:00:25.429
A skill is a playbook.

10
00:00:25.619 --> 00:00:29.299
MCP lets an assistant
discover and call tools.

11
00:00:29.439 --> 00:00:31.422
And the runtime performs the work.

12
00:00:31.423 --> 00:00:35.720
“I installed the skill,” and
“the MCP server is connected”

13
00:00:35.740 --> 00:00:37.286
are two different statements.

14
00:00:37.287 --> 00:00:40.466
RuFlo helps you plan and coordinate work,

15
00:00:40.467 --> 00:00:43.507
keep project memory,
learn from what worked,

16
00:00:43.557 --> 00:00:46.197
build repeatable workflows, test software,

17
00:00:46.367 --> 00:00:47.779
and add security checks.

18
00:00:47.846 --> 00:00:50.206
Plan a task, then fan it out.

19
00:00:50.286 --> 00:00:53.606
Research, build, and test in parallel.

20
00:00:53.686 --> 00:00:57.886
One coordinator resolves the
findings into a single review,

21
00:00:57.966 --> 00:01:01.116
and the important findings are
retained for the next session.

22
00:01:01.117 --> 00:01:03.937
More agents are not automatically cheaper.

23
00:01:03.997 --> 00:01:06.198
Measure cost per accepted result.

24
00:01:06.298 --> 00:01:09.638
And an agent saying “done”
is not a test result.

25
00:01:09.958 --> 00:01:12.058
Verify tool discovery, permissions,

26
00:01:12.228 --> 00:01:13.814
and the actual output.

27
00:01:13.874 --> 00:01:16.974
Start small, install the RuFlo skill,

28
00:01:17.024 --> 00:01:19.924
pick one project and one acceptance test.

29
00:01:20.144 --> 00:01:21.443
Add the next capability

30
00:01:21.444 --> 00:01:24.091
only when you can name
the problem it solves.
